CI GOTCHA worth knowing: a workflow run DISPATCHED by GITHUB_TOKEN cannot
trigger another workflow. deploy-prod triggers on workflow_run of the build, so
a token-dispatched build never deploys. Measured: 05:28Z push-triggered build
deployed in 3 min; 04:33Z and 06:53Z token-dispatched builds deployed nothing.
#1558 fixes it by dispatching build AND deploy explicitly. Until that merges,
converging prod by hand needs BOTH `gh workflow run build-image.yml --ref main`
and then `gh workflow run deploy-prod.yml --ref main` — the deploy resolves its
image by the sha of the ref it runs on and fails closed if that image is absent.

